| **prometheus** | `storage/secondary.go` | `secondaryQuerier` (L36) wraps `genericQuerier` and overrides `Select` (L68). Must add `SelectSorted` with `sortSeries=true`. |
| **prometheus** | `storage/generic.go` | `querierAdapter.Select` (L91) is the concrete `Querier` method. Must add `SelectSorted`. `genericQuerierAdapter` (L56) is internal only — no change needed. |
| **prometheus** | `storage/fanout.go` | `fanout.Querier` (L74) returns a `NewMergeQuerier` result. Not a direct implementor, but the returned `querierAdapter` must satisfy the new interface. |
